00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:04,220
Think of this as local, immediate, and forward-looking.

314
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:08,020
It is a catastrophic error at the very next step you try to take.

315
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:08,500
Got it.

316
00:15:08,940 --> 00:15:11,020
The second is a recursive failure.

317
00:15:11,620 --> 00:15:13,320
This is historical and global.

318
00:15:13,780 --> 00:15:20,480
It is a failure that happens not because of what you just did right now, but because of an accumulated debt of past history.

319
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:24,280
Let me make sure I'm really grasping this because the math terminology is tricky.

