00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:46,640
The failure is immediate, local, and it happens right in front of my face at step number five of building.

326
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:47,080
Yes.

327
00:15:47,620 --> 00:15:51,160
The local state cannot support the transition you were trying to make.

328
00:15:51,500 --> 00:15:52,260
Differential failure.

329
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:52,580
Okay.

