00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:17,740
It means that if you take the immediate local failure, the snapped wall, and you project it backward through the entire history of the system's states using this comparison map phi,

351
00:17:17,740 --> 00:17:23,620
you will find that the local failure is mathematically identical to the historical failure.

352
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:24,780
Wait, really?

