00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:25,280
Yes.

354
00:17:25,780 --> 00:17:27,880
The structural flaw is singular.

355
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:30,820
You are just viewing it from different coordinates in time.

356
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:32,260
I'm trying to visualize this.

