00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:44,580
If you unfold the paper, it looks like there's a hole on the top left and a completely separate hole on the bottom right.

360
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:45,380
One is differential.

361
00:17:45,620 --> 00:17:46,480
One is recursive.

362
00:17:46,640 --> 00:17:49,020
They look like two different problems in two different places.

