00:17:49,860 --> 00:17:58,180
But when you fold the system back up into its true topological shape, you see that the needle only pierce the paper in one single place.

365
00:17:58,520 --> 00:18:00,100
There is no independent tear.

366
00:18:00,460 --> 00:18:01,140
Okay, wow.

367
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:06,000
So a system that is locally valid must also be historically valid.

368
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:10,740
If there is a tear in the fabric of an idea, you're going to hit it eventually,

369
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:14,140
whether you're looking forward at your next step or looking backward at your history.

370
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:17,080
The failure isn't random bad luck.

371
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:19,920
It lives in a very specific mathematical space.

372
00:18:20,520 --> 00:18:21,520
Failure has a shape.

373
00:18:22,040 --> 00:18:27,800
And if you map where a system tears differentially, you can predict exactly where it will tear recursively.

