00:20:59,080 --> 00:21:02,560
system of time, it looks like historical irreversibility.

422
00:21:02,820 --> 00:21:03,660
It looks like entropy.

423
00:21:04,060 --> 00:21:04,200
Wow.

424
00:21:04,620 --> 00:21:09,060
A system that is locally curved must, by definition, be historically irreversible.

425
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:14,560
And any system that has accumulated entropy must be inhabiting a curved region of field space.

426
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:16,940
They are the exact same tear in the fabric.

